"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001","text":"弟子四，歷尚書金部郎。大同初，遷右丞。兄弟性並剛烈。子四自右丞上封事，極言得失，高祖甚善之，詔尚書詳擇施行焉。左民郎沈炯、少府丞顧璵嘗奏事不允，高祖厲色呵責之；子四乃趨前代炯等對，言甚激切，高祖怒呼縛之，子四據地不受，高祖怒亦止，乃釋之。猶坐免職。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":26,"last_line":26,"raw_start":2020,"raw_end":2144,"raw_character_offsets":[2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026,2027,2028,2029,2030,2031,2032,2033,2034,2035,2036,2037,2038,2039,2040,2041,2042,2043,2044,2045,2046,2047,2048,2049,2050,2051,2052,2053,2054,2055,2056,2057,2058,2059,2060,2061,2062,2063,2064,2065,2066,2067,2068,2069,2070,2071,2072,2073,2074,2075,2076,2077,2078,2079,2080,2081,2082,2083,2084,2085,2086,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099,2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,2125,2126,2127,2128,2129,2130,2131,2132,2133,2134,2135,2136,2137,2138,2139,2140,2141,2142,2143],"revision_id":2087360},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"子四","kind":"person","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"子四","kind":"person","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"沈炯","kind":"person","person_id":"j6f_ufq_av2_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"顧璵","kind":"person","person_id":"ogc_45x_ckt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"子四","kind":"person","person_id":"z8m_9y0_s2w_*****AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"炯","kind":"person","person_id":"j6f_ufq_av2_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-043-jiangzisi:p001:m01